      "Captain Hook paced the deck of his dark ship, his iron hook gleaming in the moonlight. 'Tonight,' he hissed to Smee, 'we shall make them walk the plank!' But suddenly, across the quiet water, came the dreadful sound: 'Tick, tick, tick, tick!' Hook turned white as paper. 'The crocodile!' he gasped, leaping behind a barrel of gunpowder.",
