      "From the old and pleasantly situated village of Mayenfeld, a footpath winds through green, well-wooded stretches of country to the foot of the heights, which look down over the valley. As the path begins to climb, the land becomes wilder and steeper, and the traveler soon finds himself surrounded by the fresh, resinous scent of pines and wild mountain pastures.",
      "Along this narrow mountain path, on a clear, sunny June morning, walked a tall, strong-looking girl from the village, leading by the hand a little child whose cheeks were glowing with heat. The child was five years old, but she was wrapped up in so many heavy clothes that she could scarcely move. Over her ordinary garments she wore two thick woolen dresses, and around her shoulders a red shawl was pinned tightly, while on her feet were heavy mountain shoes.",
      "The little girl looked hot and uncomfortable, but she walked bravely alongside her companion without a single murmur of complaint. The pair had climbed for more than an hour when they reached a small cluster of cottages called the Hamlet. Here the people were all known to the older girl, Dete, and from every open window and doorway voices greeted her.",
      "'Where are you going, Dete, with the child?' asked a woman who stood by her garden gate. 'Is that your sister's little one?'",
      "'Yes, it is Heidi,' answered Dete. 'I am taking her up to her grandfather on the Alm. I have been offered a good position in Frankfurt, and I cannot keep the child with me any longer.'",
