      "At last, after another long climb, they reached the green plateau where the Alm-Uncle's hut stood under three huge, ancient pine trees. Behind the hut rose the towering gray peaks of the mountain, looking proudly into the blue sky.",
      "The old man was sitting on a wooden bench outside his door, his pipe in his mouth and his hands resting on his knees. He had a thick, bushy gray beard and heavy eyebrows that met over his piercing eyes. As Heidi ran forward, she held out her small hand and looked up into his weathered face.",
      "'Good morning, Grandfather!' she said with a bright smile.",
      "The old man took her hand in his large, hardened palm and looked intently into her clear, dark eyes. 'What is this?' he asked gruffly. 'Who brought you here?'",
